            <li class="a" style="--d:4"><span class="dot"></span><b>Graduated · 2024</b><span>sat exactly where you are sitting</span></li>
            <li class="a" style="--d:5"><span class="dot"></span><b>Taboola</b><span>working in the industry for the past year and a half</span></li>
            <li class="a" style="--d:6"><span class="dot glow"></span><b>Back — as your TA</b><span>Jerusalem Interdisciplinary College</span></li>
          </ol>
